accTitle: Keep the previous environment ready for rollback
accDescr: Both environments remain alive after a production CNAME swap so that the mapping can be reversed and clients using older DNS answers still have a target.
P["Production CNAME"] -->|Before swap| B["Blue: previous version"]
P -.->|After validation and swap| G["Green: new version"]
B --> R["Retained through rollback window"]
G --> H["Observe health and errors"]
H -->|Rollback if needed| P
class P inputData
class H decision
class B,G output
class R storage
